%modern

#! Test-only module that creates thread pools for its callers
/** @section sandboxpoolfixtureintro Introduction
    Module code that creates a @ref Qore::Thread::ThreadPool "ThreadPool".  The module's Program gets the sandbox of the
    Program that loads it first, so a pool that it creates for a sandboxed Program that loaded it counts against that
    sandbox's thread limit.  It must not be loaded by the test script itself.
*/
module SandboxPoolFixture {
    version = "1.0";
    desc = "Sandbox thread limit fixture: module code that creates thread pools";
    author = "Qore Technologies";
    url = "https://qore.org";
    license = "MIT";
}

public namespace SandboxPoolFixture {
    #! Creates a ThreadPool in the module's Program
    public ThreadPool sub make_pool(int max_threads) {
        return new ThreadPool(max_threads);
    }
}
